* K: \(|M^{2}-0.243|<0.005\) GeV\({}^{2}\)/\(c^{4}\), \(|n\sigma_{K}|<4\)
* \(\pi\) (from TOF PID): \(|M^{2}-0.019|<0.003\) GeV\({}^{2}\)/\(c^{4}\), \(|n\sigma_{\pi}|<4\)
